# ---------- Redridge III ----------
A 128 | Follow the road east over Three Corners to Lakeshire. Guard Howe stands at the south end of the bridge (26.4,57.9)
A 126 | Verner Osgood, Lakeshire (25.9,47.3)
A 180 | The wanted poster in Lakeshire (21.7,46.4)
C 126 @ Redridge Mountains, 22.6, 21.4 | Go north out of Lakeshire into the canyons. Yowler (25) stands in the gnoll camp at 22.6,21.4. Everything here is grey or green to you
C 128 @ Redridge Mountains, 24.5, 12.0 | Further north, the Blackrock camp (21-31,6-17): kill 15 Blackrock Champions (24-25)
A 219 | Corporal Keeshan, held in the same camp (23.3,12.6). Clear the orcs around him first, then accept: it is an escort
C 219 @ Redridge Mountains, 26.0, 30.0 | Walk with Keeshan back to Lakeshire. He fights everything on the way and you cannot heal him: kill what he attacks fast, Polymorph an extra one, and do not run ahead
T 219 | Marshal Marris, Lakeshire
T 126 | Verner Osgood
T 128 | Guard Howe, at the bridge
C 180 @ Redridge Mountains, 75.1, 37.1 | Lieutenant Fangore (26) is far east in Galardell Valley, in the Shadowhide camp at 75.1,37.1. Take the road east past Stonewatch. Gnolls stand with him: Polymorph one of them and kill him first
C 1938 @ Redridge Mountains, 73.8, 47.6 | The Tower of Ilgalar stands a short walk south of Fangore's camp. Shadowhide Darkweavers and Slayers (25-26) guard the way: one at a time, Counterspell the Darkweavers. Ur's Treatise on Shadow Magic is a book inside the tower (its floor is not in the data). Morganth (26, elite) lives in the tower: do not fight him. If he stands between you and the book, Polymorph him (he is human), take the book and leave before it breaks
T 180 | Magistrate Solomon, Lakeshire (24.9,44.5)
N Cast Teleport: Stormwind | One rune. It lands you in the Wizard's Sanctum, where the book goes. No rune? Fly to Stormwind from Ariena Stormfeather in Lakeshire and walk to the Mage Quarter
T 1938 | High Sorcerer Andromath, at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum
A 1940 | High Sorcerer Andromath. The spiders are in Duskwood, where you go now
FLY Darkshire @ Stormwind City, 71.0, 72.5 | Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master in the Trade District. Buy Runes of Teleportation on the way if you are down to one

