C 222 @ Duskwood, 69.0, 76.0 | South of Darkshire (61-74,67-84): 8 Nightbane Vile Fangs (29-30) and 8 Nightbane Tainted Ones (30-31). Work in from the north edge, one at a time, Polymorph when a second comes, Fire Blast runners
C 181 @ Duskwood, 37.0, 81.5 | South road west to the Vul'Gol Ogre Mound. Zzarc'Vul (33) is at the south end of the mound (36-38,80-84) with Splinter Fist Enslavers (30-31). Clear the way in one ogre at a time, wait until he stands apart from the others, then Frostbolt from maximum range, Frost Nova when he reaches you, Blink away and keep casting; Mana Shield if he stays on you. Loot the Ogre's Monocle. If he kills you twice, drop the quest. Finish Merrick's Bow here if it is still open
C 98447 @ Duskwood, 17.4, 54.0 | Only if Sirra gave you the second Valor Family quest. Go to Raven Hill village (17.4,54.0, near Jitters) with the dagger and the bow in your bags until "Raven Hill investigated" ticks. What appears there is not in the data: be ready for a fight
C 58 @ Duskwood, 22.8, 33.2 | North into the cemetery: 20 Plague Spreaders (27-28) around the eastern mausoleum and the graves below Abercrombie's hill (16-26,28-37). A mage cannot remove their disease: kill them at range, eat or bandage after each fight
C 1940 @ Duskwood, 20.0, 41.2 | 8 Pristine Spider Silk. Carrion Recluses (25-26) crawl around the west and south side of the cemetery (17-23, 37-46); there are only a few, so also kill every Black Widow Hatchling (24-25) you see in the woods north of the main road. Most kills drop one
