C 98 @ Duskwood, 77.3, 36.2 | Stalvan Mistmantle (32) is in the cottage north of Darkshire at 77.3,36.2. Fetid Corpses (29-30) stand around it: kill the ones near the door first. Then full health and mana, pull him out of the house with Frostbolt from maximum range, Frost Nova when he reaches you, Blink away and keep casting; Mana Shield when you are low. He is undead: no Polymorph. He drops the Mistmantle Family Ring. Too strong? Abandon the quest and move on
T 98 | Madame Eva, in her house (75.8,45.3)
