N Segment done. In the log: 270, 1248 and 98223 (Menethil), 472 (Dun Modr), 690 (Refuge Pointe), 98219 (Southshore), 1026 (Ashenvale) | Stay in Stormwind: segment 12 starts at Jennea Cannon, the mage trainer in the tower behind Malin. Your hearthstone stays in Darkshire until Southshore
